    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/04830376d71ae50fb87302f391a818b6.poster.avif?t=1741373284\" width=700 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/04830376d71ae50fb87302f391a818b6.webm?t=1741373284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/04830376d71ae50fb87302f391a818b6.mp4?t=1741373284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>ARKHAM MYSTERIES: CHAPTER ONE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover what should never have been revealed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>narrative adventure of mystery and exploration</strong>, where every discovery brings you closer to the truth\u2026 or to your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/1b960d81a2f729682b3a1237284c8111.avif?t=1741373284\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As detective <strong>John Graves</strong>, you will follow the trail of the missing <strong>Professor Wellington</strong>, guided by the enigmatic <strong>Samantha Damasco</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/397e1cd96e4bcc47cd6bcd7f8595b0f4.poster.avif?t=1741373284\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/397e1cd96e4bcc47cd6bcd7f8595b0f4.webm?t=1741373284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/397e1cd96e4bcc47cd6bcd7f8595b0f4.mp4?t=1741373284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong> can reveal the unseen. Explore hidden dimensions and unravel enigmas while unknown forces lurk in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/966d38460513401d22772b10027d44e0.poster.avif?t=1741373284\" width=700 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/966d38460513401d22772b10027d44e0.webm?t=1741373284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/966d38460513401d22772b10027d44e0.mp4?t=1741373284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features &amp; Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Exploration:</strong> Dive into a dark world full of mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Every decision will shape the outcome of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dimensional Travel:</strong> Use the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong> to uncover secrets in hidden realities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enigmatic Puzzles:</strong> Test your logic and wit to solve intricate riddles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian Creatures:</strong> Survive cosmic horrors using your ingenuity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/0d0104750e9c1548c0f2e909eaf6b372.avif?t=1741373284\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Case Wrapped in Shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shoes of detective <strong>John Graves</strong>, you will delve into a mystery where logic and sanity begin to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enigmatic singer <strong>Samantha Damasco</strong> has entrusted you with finding <strong>Professor Wellington</strong>, a man whose disappearance is tied to ancient secrets that should have remained buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the power of the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong>, you will cross the threshold of the impossible, unveiling horrors that lurk beyond reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some answers come at a price\u2026 <strong>Are you willing to pay it?</strong></p>",
