eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013080/extras/0d0104750e9c1548c0f2e909eaf6b372.avif?t=1741373284\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Case Wrapped in Shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shoes of detective <strong>John Graves</strong>, you will delve into a mystery where logic and sanity begin to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enigmatic singer <strong>Samantha Damasco</strong> has entrusted you with finding <strong>Professor Wellington</strong>, a man whose disappearance is tied to ancient secrets that should have remained buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the power of the <strong>Eye of Kadath</strong>, you will cross the threshold of the impossible, unveiling horrors that lurk beyond reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some answers come at a price\u2026 <strong>Are you willing to pay it?</strong></p>",
